At a glance:

4
00:00:10.639 --> 00:00:11.812
Chapter at a glance.

5
00:00:12.092 --> 00:00:18.385
Sector: energy and utilities (electricity distribution), and IoT telemetry more generally.

6
00:00:18.665 --> 00:00:21.567
