7
00:00:21.847 --> 00:00:22.849
Reader bands:

8
00:00:23.129 --> 00:00:24.644
B1, then B4.

9
00:00:24.924 --> 00:00:25.820
Builds on:

10
00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:29.428
