16
00:00:51.847 --> 00:01:11.687
RF mesh, cellular NB-IoT or 4G and PLC;. the Head-End System (HES), which talks DLMS or COSEM to meters;. the Meter Data Management (MDM) system, with validation, estimation and editing (VEE);. billing and prepaid balance with remote disconnect and reconnect;.

17
00:01:13.037 --> 00:01:23.896
outage detection, power quality and theft detection;. firmware-over-the-air (FOTA) updates;. load forecasting and demand response;. an energy-accounting data platform.

18
00:01:24.176 --> 00:01:42.096
It also explains the algorithms: interval data validation and gap estimation, time-of-day tariff rating, prepaid balance projection, outage inference, theft and anomaly detection, transformer energy balancing, load forecasting, staged OTA rollout and read scheduling.

19
00:01:42.376 --> 00:01:43.976
